OL,3,GNEWSAChampion boxer Joe Cordina was
OL,4,A'retaliating' when he punched man to
OL,5,Aground, court hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer boxing world champion Joe
OL,8,FCordina was "retaliating" during a
OL,9,Ffight where he punched a man at a
OL,10,Fpetrol station, a court has heard.
OL,12,FCordina is standing trial charged with
OL,13,Fassault by beating relating to an
OL,14,Fincident on 27 February involving Jamie
OL,15,FO'Brien.
OL,17,FCardiff Magistrates' Court heard the
OL,18,Faltercation came to light days later
OL,19,Fafter a video was published on
OL,20,FWalesOnline, filmed by a witness at a
OL,21,FTexaco garage in the Pentwyn area of
OL,22,FCardiff.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
